nasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高景庵读旧题有感","author":"范成大","text":"莓苔风雨旧诗留，十七年前鬓未秋。\n岩桂拂云篁竹拱，树犹如此一搔头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":32252,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高楼曲","author":"范成大","text":"岁暮天涯客，黄昏蝙蝠飞。\n高楼人不到，小雨怯单衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":32253,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偃月泉","author":"范成大","text":"松风竹露午犹寒，知有龙蟠一掬悭。\n我欲今年来结夏，莫扃岫幌掩云关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":32254,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"假十二峰","author":"范成大","text":"巴东三峡数巫阳，山入西陵更郁苍。\n何以假为非确论，直疑溟涬弟高唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":32255,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"范成大","text":"伯劳东去燕西飞，同寄春风二月时。\n可恨同时不同调，此情那得更相知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":32256,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"范成大","text":"出处由人不系天，痴儿富贵更求仙。\n东家就食西家宿，世事何缘得两全。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":32257,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶箴","author":"范成大","text":"情知万法本来空，犹复将心奉八风。\n逆顺境来欣戚变，咄哉谁是主人翁。","col